                    </h2>

                    <div style="background: #ff6f00; color: white; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.3);">
                        Steel Door & Window Fabricators-designed <br>
                        Smart Drawing & Costing Software
                    </div>

                    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
                        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500;">
                            <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #4caf50; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><i data-lucide="check" style="color: white; width: 14px;"></i></div>
                            Faster Design
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500;">
                             <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #4caf50; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><i data-lucide="check" style="color: white; width: 14px;"></i></div>
                            Accurate Kg & Labour Cost
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500;">
                             <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #4caf50; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><i data-lucide="check" style="color: white; width: 14px;"></i></div>
                            Logo Instant Quotation
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500;">
                             <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; background: #4caf50; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><i data-lucide="check" style="color: white; width: 14px;"></i></div>
                            Less Waste - More Profit
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
                        <button class="btn" style="background: #1a237e; color: white; padding: 1rem 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem; border-radius: 50px; border: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.4);" onclick="window.calcSwitchTab('detailed')">
                            Start Detailed Calculation <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Feature Visual / Mini Preview -->
                <div style="position: relative; height: 400px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                    <!-- Abstract geometric background -->
                    <div style="position: absolute; width: 300px; height: 300px; background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.05); border-radius: 50%; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);"></div>
                    <div style="position: absolute; width: 200px; height: 200px; background: rgba(216, 27, 96, 0.05); border-radius: 50%; top: 60%; left: 40%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);"></div>
                    
                    <!-- Preview Card -->
                     <div class="glass-panel" style="background: white; color: #333; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); width: 320px; transform: rotate(-5deg); border: 1px solid #eee;">
